# Keep the build context small and reproducible.
#
# The Containerfile copies `shell/` and `activities/` into the image
# (build_files/60-shell.sh and 64-first-party-activities.sh install them), and
# both hold a uv venv and several caches on a developer's machine. None of
# that belongs in an OS image -- a stale
# `__pycache__` compiled by a different Python would even be *imported* by the
# image's Python 3.14.
.git/
output/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.py[cod]
